        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SimpleCompliance is based in Toronto, Canada.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Many organizations struggle to keep up with new health and safety requirements, particularly regarding workplace safety.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Federal legislation applies to workplace safety, but protections can vary by state or province.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Ontario, individuals have the right to an independent investigation of harassment complaints by a trained professional under Bill 132.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Definitions of workplace violence may include suspected domestic violence.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Certain states have legislation addressing workplace safety for high-risk occupations such as health care and retail.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 0,
        "char_start": 0,
        "char_end": 1800
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Ontario, individuals have the right to an independent investigation of a complaint of harassment by a trained professional as per Bill 132.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Many definitions of workplace violence include suspected domestic violence.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Organizations can be held liable for not conducting a yearly risk assessment.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SIMPLE COMPLIANCE software provides organizations with a comprehensive risk assessment, e-learning system, and incident reporting app.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The SIMPLE COMPLIANCE software is monitored by an independent third party and held on secure external servers.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SIMPLE COMPLIANCE is raising funds for three uses, including validating their organizational risk assessment.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Once validated at an academic level, the risk assessment can be offered as part of the overall package of SIMPLE COMPLIANCE.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "SIMPLE COMPLIANCE needs updates to keep pace with evolving laws in the area of workplace safety.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bill 138 was recently introduced in Ontario related to workplace safety laws.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 1,
        "char_start": 1400,
        "char_end": 3200
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A comprehensive risk assessment has been developed that looks at 12 different areas of the organization for workplace violence risks.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Bill 138 in Ontario states that everybody has the right to an independent, trained investigator when an incident has been submitted.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "suspect_numeric": false,
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The software is being updated to ensure that investigation reports can be accessed by authorized personnel with security measures.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Investigation reports will be secured to prevent changes once an investigator has submitted them.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "An email will be generated to all interested parties with a code to access the report on a read-only basis.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Liability is identified as the largest risk faced by the organization.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "risk",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The software is not intended to provide legal advice but to give organizations tools to be compliant with the law.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A lawyer may need to be consulted if further action is required beyond the software's capabilities.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The laws regarding workplace violence are different in each state/province and are constantly changing.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The software must be kept up-to-date to ensure compliance in as many jurisdictions as possible.",
      "dimensions": [
        "feasibility"
      ],
      "type": "other",
      "primary_dimension": "feasibility",
      "meta": {
        "proposal_id": "kt81__openai",
        "chunk_index": 2,
        "char_start": 2800,
        "char_end": 4600
      }
    }
  ]
}